      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Yes, I'm not sure \"how\" and what it changes but \uD83E\uDD37 \nAnd then of course there is the `ESD_MK` layer which is just a marker for DRC \uD83D\uDE05 \n(I actually had to add this marker to some cells I work on now for chipalooza because some devices are required to be marked as such or they don't pass DRC ... )",
